    <section class='section section--mist' id='faq'>
      <div class='wrap'>
        <div class='section-head'>
          <span class='eyebrow'>FAQ</span>
          <h2>Common questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class='faq'>
          <details>
            <summary>What is a "static website"?</summary>
            <p>A website that presents your business: who you are, your services or menu, photos, opening hours, location and how to contact you. It doesn't sell products or take payments online. Most local businesses only need this, and it starts at €450 one-time.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>What if I want to sell products or take payments?</summary>
            <p>Online shops and websites with any kind of purchasing or payments aren't covered by the €450 price. They start from €900. Use the <a href='/pages/get-a-quote' style='color:var(--blue);text-decoration:underline'>quote builder</a> or contact me for a personal quote.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Can you add online booking for my restaurant, barber or salon?</summary>
            <p>Yes. I build online booking for restaurants, barbers, salons, dentists and more. The booking system costs €250 per year, on top of the website.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>How much does an app cost?</summary>
            <p>Apps start at €1,000. The final price depends on the features you need. Tell me your idea and I'll give you a clear quote.</p>
          </details>
          <details>
            <summary>Is the price really one-time?</summary>
            <p>Yes. The design and build fee is paid once. The only yearly cost is the online booking system (€250 per year), if you choose one.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

